of our outstanding accounts receivable at December 31, 2025. During the year ended December 31, 2024, sales to one customer totaled $<span id="xdx_901_eus-gaap--Revenues_c20240101__20241231__srt--MajorCustomersAxis__custom--OneCustomerMember__us-gaap--ConcentrationRiskByBenchmarkAxis__us-gaap--SalesRevenueNetMember__us-gaap--ConcentrationRiskByTypeAxis__us-gaap--CustomerConcentrationRiskMember_zBRF2zqxQJP"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:Revenues" contextRef="From2024-01-012024-12-31_custom_OneCustomerMember_us-gaap_SalesRevenueNetMember_us-gaap_CustomerConcentrationRiskMember" id="Fact000635" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="0" unitRef="USD">726,292</ix:nonFraction></span></span><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">,
