<span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">for the years ended December 31, 2025 and 2024, respectively,
and are included in net sales on the Statement of Operations. Shipping and handling costs for shipping product to customers totaled $<span id="xdx_906_ecustom--ShippingAndHandlingCostsForShippingProduct_c20250101__20251231_znkP7v1NJ7tk"><ix:nonFraction name="xpon:ShippingAndHandlingCostsForShippingProduct" contextRef="From2025-01-01to2025-12-31" id="Fact000670" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="0" unitRef="USD">357,484</ix:nonFraction></span></span>
