<p style="margin: 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt"><i>Warrant Inducement
and Repricing</i></span></p>

<p style="margin: 0; text-align: justify; background-color: white; color: #212529"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">&#160;</span></p>

<p style="margin: 0; text-align: justify; background-color: white; color: #212529"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">On
August 14, 2025, the Company entered into an inducement offer letter agreements with certain holders of the Series A Warrants and the
January 2025 Warrants, which reduced the exercise price of the Series A Warrants from $<span id="xdx_90D_eus-gaap--SharesIssuedPricePerShare_iI_c20250814__us-gaap--AwardTypeAxis__custom--SeriesAWarrantMember_z31woMk5Nvrg"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:SharesIssuedPricePerShare" contextRef="AsOf2025-08-14_custom_SeriesAWarrantMember" id="Fact001086" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="INF" unitRef="USDPShares">5.206</ix:nonFraction></span></span>
<span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">to $1.31 per share, and the January 2025 Warrants from <span id="xdx_906_eus-gaap--SharesIssuedPricePerShare_iI_c20250131__us-gaap--AwardTypeAxis__custom--WarrantInducementMember_zzLms49kzwbj"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:SharesIssuedPricePerShare" contextRef="AsOf2025-01-31_custom_WarrantInducementMember" id="Fact001087" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="INF" unitRef="USDPShares">2.36</ix:nonFraction></span></span>
<span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">to $1.31 per share. The difference between the fair value of
the warrants immediately prior to and following modification was treated as a transaction cost, which is netted against proceeds received.
The difference in fair value for the Series A Warrants was $1,423,166</span><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">,
and the difference in fair value for the January 2025 Warrants was $97,746. Both were calculated using the Black-Scholes option-pricing
model and were based on the following assumptions:</span></p>

<p style="margin: 0; text-align: justify; background-color: white"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">&#160;</span></p>

