ESPP. On January 1, 2026, an aggregate of 97,817 shares were added to the plan reserve pursuant to the evergreen provision based on the
number of shares outstanding as of December 31, 2025.</span></p>

<p style="margin: 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">&#160;</span></p>

<p style="margin: 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">No shares have been
issued under the 2021 ESPP.</span></p>

<p style="margin: 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">&#160;</span></p>

