<span id="xdx_821_zbVtIf5on6Ib">Income Taxes</span></i></b></span></p>

<p style="margin: 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">&#160;</span></p>

<p style="margin: 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">Our losses before
income taxes for the years ended December 31, 2025 and 2024 were generated primarily from U.S. operations.</span></p>

<p style="margin: 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">&#160;</span></p>

<p style="margin: 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">We have no current
or deferred provision for income taxes from continuing operations for the years ended December 31, 2025 and 2024.</span></p>

<p style="margin: 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">&#160;</span></p>

<p style="margin: 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">The significant differences
between the U.S. Federal statutory rate and our effective rate for financial reporting purposes are as follows:</span></p>

